  "content": "\n\n<pre><span>目前為《化石與考古》模組新增了 3 種尚未收錄的物種。這並非該模組的官方新增內容，僅是一批動物：史前野牛、洞獅、</span>以及長毛犀。<span>這些動物的玩法與主模組並不完全相同，只是稍微有些不同</span> <img style=\"font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e6884ae7-f45e-4550-870e-782bdc0364b2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"162\" height=\"112\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e1089c77-8577-4a52-a88a-70d9e84f75a5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"187\" height=\"129\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d9760730-9c2d-47b9-8ef1-7fe7fafa901b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"264\" height=\"200\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c4c3c846-ecd0-4802-987d-563183b4ea7f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"481\" height=\"302\"> </pre>\n<hr>\n<pre><strong><span>此模組需要 Geckolib</span></strong></pre>",
